#: axialnest-for-woocommerce.php:35
msgid ""
"Axialnest Woocommerce requires WooCommerce to be installed and active. You "
"can download %s here."
msgstr ""
"AxialNest requiere que Woocommerce este instalado y activo. Puedes "
"descargarlo %s aquí."

